WEBVTT

00:00:00.477 --> 00:00:06.277
Welcome to UniQCAI: one console that collects every quick-commerce report for your brands.

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:10.007
An admin signs in with their work email and password.

00:00:14.621 --> 00:00:17.059
All your client brands sit in one list.

00:00:17.059 --> 00:00:18.371
Let's open Del Monte.

00:00:19.859 --> 00:00:26.669
Each brand shows its platform connections, split into Ads and Sales, with a live health status for every login.

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.354
Here is an important safety check.

00:00:29.354 --> 00:00:32.243
One portal login can hold several businesses.

00:00:32.243 --> 00:00:39.950
If the portal shows a different business than expected, UniQCAI stops, rather than downloading the wrong company's data.

00:00:43.064 --> 00:00:45.583
Access controls who can see this brand.

00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:49.524
Each brand team sees only its own brand, and its own reports.

00:00:52.654 --> 00:00:55.433
Platform accounts lists every portal login.

00:00:55.433 --> 00:00:57.695
One login can serve several brands.

00:00:57.695 --> 00:01:01.444
Passwords are stored encrypted, and are never shown again.

00:01:05.216 --> 00:01:07.965
Connecting a new platform is a guided set-up.

00:01:07.965 --> 00:01:14.136
Choose the platform, add the login, choose where the verification code arrives, and pick the reports.

00:01:17.253 --> 00:01:23.420
Verification codes arrive in these mailboxes, and UniQCAI reads them automatically.

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:25.723
Nobody has to forward an O.T.P.

00:01:28.773 --> 00:01:36.023
To download on demand, choose the brand, tick the reports you need, pick a date range, and start the run with a single click.

00:01:41.044 --> 00:01:49.664
Coming next: run history with live progress, daily schedules, and the report library, where every downloaded file is ready for your team.

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:53.997
Set it up once, and your reports are collected every day.
